TICKET-002: CI/CD pipeline

Priority: P0 · Estimate: 3 pts · Depends on: 001
GitHub Actions: on PR → lint + unit tests + Android assembleDebug; on merge to `main` → deploy backend to Cloud Run (staging), build signed AAB artifact.

Tasks

- PR workflow: ktlint, unit tests, backend tests, build check
- Main workflow: backend Docker build → push to Artifact Registry → deploy to Cloud Run staging
- Store signing keys and service-account creds in GitHub Secrets (never in repo)
- Add status badges to README

Acceptance criteria

- A failing test blocks merge
- Merge to main auto-deploys staging backend in < 10 min
- No credentials appear in any tracked file (verified with gitleaks step in CI)
